  <UserdefinedSymbols />
  <Comments>RangeLab — AssaultCube 1.3.0.2, x86
Verified executable SHA-256: 5b588e6ff7710fa0170553506a50bfa14750ccb438a154e4ea0e0b1ba621cefb
Local player pointer resolved after a full game restart. Health and ammo were confirmed in the HUD.
Attach Cheat Engine to ac_client.exe. Expand a group, edit a value, and check its box to freeze it.
No startup Lua and no edits enabled automatically. Trainer feature checkboxes execute embedded Lua only when checked.
Trainer scripts enforce the known executable MD5, module layout and player/weapon references. Manual records have no such guard.
Trainer presets restore captured fields when unchecked. Manual CE changes do not automatically restore original values.
Do not run RangeLab and CE trainer scripts on the same fields together. Uncheck all trainer scripts before changing process/table.
Aim/auto shoot defaults: hold Alt, focus game, 35 degree cone, smoothing 4, players and bots; teammates skipped in team modes. Bunny hop: hold Space.
Reserve-fed refill consumes reserve ammo; aiming, shooting, jumps and refills are gameplay actions and cannot be undone.
The selected-weapon ID is for inspection; changing it alone does not update weapon-object references.
Weapon stats are shared. Special shotgun spread/damage calculations may differ. Use for offline practice.
Developer: Primo / supremobv.</Comments>
</CheatTable>